{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2020-04-22 10:30:00', 'title': 'HPE ROLLS OUT EXTENSIVE FINANCIAL RELIEF AND SUPPORT INITIATIVES FOR PARTNERS IMPACTED BY COVID-19', 'text': 'HPE ROLLS OUT EXTENSIVE FINANCIAL RELIEF AND SUPPORT INITIATIVES FOR PARTNERS IMPACTED BY COVID-19.HPE- SUSPENDED REVENUE TARGETS REQUIRED FOR PARTNERS TO MAINTAIN THEIR STATUS IN HPE HYBRID IT PARTNER READY PROGRAM FOR 2021 ELIGIBILITY.HEWLETT PACKARD - WILL EXTEND PAYMENT TERMS FROM 60 TO 90 DAYS IN NORTH AMERICA AND EUROPE FOR PARTICIPANTS IN EXISTING ENHANCED FACTORING PROGRAMS.HEWLETT PACKARD - HAS TEMPORARILY SUSPENDED OR SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCED STRATEGIC DEVELOPMENT INITIATIVE TARGETS IN MOST GEOGRAPHIES FOR PARTNERS.HPE - FROM MAY 1 - JULY 31, DISTRIBUTORS IN N.AMERICA NOT PARTICIPATING IN FACTORING PROGRAMS CAN TAKE ADVANTAGE OF EXTENDED EARLY PAY DISCOUNT TERMS.'}